OL,3,GNEWSATrader fears stall will not
OL,4,Asurvive city works
OL,5,
OL,6,FA market trader in Coventry has said he
OL,7,Fis concerned his business might not
OL,8,Fsurvive as he has seen sales plummet
OL,9,Famid a lengthy redevelopment of the
OL,10,Fwider area.
OL,12,FAmjad Hussain runs a sports supplements
OL,13,Fstall at Coventry Market on Queen
OL,14,FVictoria Road, and said he was pleased
OL,15,Fthe local authority planned to invest
OL,16,F#1.25m in revamping the building as
OL,17,Fpart of the City Centre South project.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
