OL,3,GNEWSATrader fears stall will not
OL,4,Asurvive city works
OL,5,
OL,6,FLike many other traders in the market,
OL,7,Fhis rent has been reduced by the
OL,8,Fcouncil to reflect the disruption, but
OL,9,Fhe said sales had already dropped by
OL,10,F"more than 70%" since work began on the
OL,11,Fwider scheme and called for more
OL,12,Fsupport, including on parking.
OL,14,FCoventry City Council has been
OL,15,Fcontacted for comment.
